# Uploads for `vercel deploy` from the repository root. The Vercel project's Root Directory is web/, so only
# web/ (minus local build output) and the pnpm workspace files it installs from are needed; never upload
# data/ (11 GB), Rust build output or local env files.
/*
!/web
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
/web/node_modules
/web/dist
/web/.vercel
.env
.env.*
